call engineer.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. It's now running in us-east, us-west and eu-west, replacing v2.3.1.\n- **Health after the rollback:** checkout-api passes health checks again. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api) records what was failing, the rollback and the current health. Its next step is to find what broke in v2.3.1 before it's deployed again.\n\nv2.3.1's test build (v2.3.1-rc) was already marked unhealthy in staging, but v2.3.1 still went to production. It's worth finding out how that got through the release process.", "type": "text"}]}]}